{"id": "22", "question": "magellan of virginia provider", "gt": "Magellan of Virginia is a provider of behavioral health services for members enrolled in Virginia's Medicaid and FAMIS programs. They ensure the delivery of quality behavioral health services to Virginia Medicaid enrollees and work towards improving the overall health and well-being of Virginians. They also offer continuing education clock hours/credits for e-learning courses and host weekly Q&A sessions for providers to address their questions and issues.", "pred": "Magellan of Virginia is a behavioral health services provider that administers services for Medicaid and FAMIS program members in Virginia, hosts weekly provider Q&A sessions every Friday from 1 p.m. to 2:30 p.m., and ensures quality behavioral health services for Virginia Medicaid enrollees through partnerships with members, providers, and stakeholders.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Magellan of Virginia is a behavioral health services provider that administers services for Medicaid and FAMIS program members in Virginia, hosts weekly provider Q&A sessions every Friday from 1 p.m. to 2:30 p.m., and ensures quality behavioral health services for Virginia Medicaid enrollees through partnerships with members, providers, and stakeholders.", "time_sec": 6.211, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 7724, 64762, 1307, 19356, 1395, 1261, 29014, 4612, 6591, 20575, 1455, 56709, 1115, 6591, 1394, 109407, 1321, 1439, 6758, 6673, 3467, 5742, 1294, 19356, 1044, 28170, 32260, 20575, 2466, 94090, 23213, 3387, 27533, 1562, 1032, 1049, 1274, 2774, 1046, 1317, 1032, 1050, 1058, 1051, 1048, 1274, 2774, 3109, 1321, 48310, 7353, 29014, 4612, 6591, 1394, 19356