{"id": "26", "question": "magellan of virginia provider", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages.\n\nThe provided passages do not mention anything about Magellan of Virginia's status as a provider or its relationship with other providers. Passage 1 discusses Magellan's ability to offer continuing education credits, while Passage 2 explains its role as the Behavioral Health Services Administrator for Virginia's Medicaid and FAMIS programs. Passage 3 mentions a weekly call for providers to ask questions and address issues, but it does not provide information about Magellan's status as a provider. Therefore, I cannot answer the question based on the given passages.", "pred": "Magellan of Virginia is a behavioral health services provider that administers services for Medicaid and FAMIS program members in Virginia, hosts weekly provider Q&A sessions every Friday from 1 p.m. to 2:30 p.m., and ensures quality behavioral health services for Virginia Medicaid enrollees through partnerships with members, providers, and stakeholders.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Magellan of Virginia is a behavioral health services provider that administers services for Medicaid and FAMIS program members in Virginia, hosts weekly provider Q&A sessions every Friday from 1 p.m. to 2:30 p.m., and ensures quality behavioral health services for Virginia Medicaid enrollees through partnerships with members, providers, and stakeholders.", "time_sec": 6.213, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 7724, 64762, 1307, 19356, 1395, 1261, 29014, 4612, 6591, 20575, 1455, 56709, 1115, 6591, 1394, 109407, 1321, 1439, 6758, 6673, 3467, 5742, 1294, 19356, 1044, 28170, 32260, 20575, 2466, 94090, 23213