{"id": "46", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "pred": "To fold a quilt as described in the passage, follow these steps: 1) Lay the quilt on a flat surface. 2) Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias. 3) Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias. 4) Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, with the fold on the bias. 5) Finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: To fold a quilt as described in the passage, follow these steps: 1) Lay the quilt on a flat surface. 2) Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias. 3) Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias. 4) Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, with the fold on the bias. 5) Finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.", "time_sec": 10.321, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 3870, 16584, 1261, 1442, 4867, 1435, 5055, 1294, 1278, 14456, 1044, 2685, 2576, 9578, 1058, 1032, 1049, 1041, 57340, 1278, 1442, 4867, 1408, 1261, 14038, 4691, 1046, 1032, 1050, 1041, 1439, 2189, 1278, 4953, 3169, 15552, 2015, 8741, 1278, 7034, 1307, 1278, 1442, 4867, 1044, 40227, 1278, 16584, 1395, 1408, 1278, 17678, 1046, 1032, 1051, 1041, 1439, 2189, 1278, 4953, 3979, 15552, 2015, 8741, 1278, 7034, 1307, 1278, 1442, 4867, 1044, 6187, 5257, 1278, 16584, 1395, 1408, 1278, 17678, 