{"id": "49", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to fold a quilt:\n\n1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface.\n2. Fold the lower right corner up towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner up towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner down towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\n5. Fold the top right corner down towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"How to fold a quilt\" can be summarized in five steps:\n\n1. Lay the quilt flat.\n2. Fold lower right corner up.\n3. Fold lower left corner up.\n4. Fold top left corner down.\n5. Fold top right corner down.", "pred": "To fold a quilt as described in the passage, follow these steps: 1) Lay the quilt on a flat surface. 2) Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias. 3) Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias. 4) Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, with the fold on the bias. 5) Finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: To fold a quilt as described in the passage, follow these steps: 1) Lay the quilt on a flat surface. 2) Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias. 3) Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias. 4) Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, with the fold on the bias. 5) Finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.", "time_sec": 10.281,