{"id": "51", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "A water pick has several benefits, according to the given passages. It can help eliminate germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush. It can also massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. Additionally, a water pick can clean better around the teeth and gums, reaching areas that brushing may not be able to access.", "pred": "Water picks help maintain oral health by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque, especially in areas brushing cannot reach. They massage and stimulate soft tissue to reduce gingivitis risk, clean better around teeth and gums, and remove food from inaccessible areas.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Water picks help maintain oral health by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque, especially in areas brushing cannot reach. They massage and stimulate soft tissue to reduce gingivitis risk, clean better around teeth and gums, and remove food from inaccessible areas.", "time_sec": 5.332, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 17231, 65438, 3508, 7766, 17580, 4612, 1536, 29521, 1261, 5666, 10197, 1307, 4180, 1513, 1278, 66282, 3110, 1317, 31924, 22146, 1115, 1321, 41345, 1044, 7702, 1294, 7224, 102394, 6560, 8132, 1046, 4159, 68664, 1321, 51578, 6444, 9392, 1317, 9980, 18616, 1354, 11505, 5735, 1044, 9375, 4942, 3879, 20277, 1321, 1343, 11558, 1044, 1321, 8559, 6939, 1562, 109753, 7224, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.0315, -0.0092, -0.6148, -0.319, -0.1114, -0.1017, -0.4096, -0.0001, -0.0659, -0.2008, -0.0604, -0.1322, -0.0162, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0985, -0.