{"id": "52", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include maintaining good oral health, reducing the risk of gingivitis, cleaning better around the teeth and gums, and eliminating tough-to-remove germs and plaque from the gum line.", "pred": "Water picks help maintain oral health by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque, especially in areas brushing cannot reach. They massage and stimulate soft tissue to reduce gingivitis risk, clean better around teeth and gums, and remove food from inaccessible areas.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Water picks help maintain oral health by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque, especially in areas brushing cannot reach. They massage and stimulate soft tissue to reduce gingivitis risk, clean better around teeth and gums, and remove food from inaccessible areas.", "time_sec": 5.169, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 17231, 65438, 3508, 7766, 17580, 4612, 1536, 29521, 1261, 5666, 10197, 1307, 4180, 1513, 1278, 66282, 3110, 1317, 31924, 22146, 1115, 1321, 41345, 1044, 7702, 1294, 7224, 102394, 6560, 8132, 1046, 4159, 68664, 1321, 51578, 6444, 9392, 1317, 9980, 18616, 1354, 11505, 5735, 1044, 9375, 4942, 3879, 20277, 1321, 1343, 11558, 1044, 1321, 8559, 6939, 1562, 109753, 7224, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.0315, -0.0092, -0.6148, -0.319, -0.1114, -0.1017, -0.4096, -0.0001, -0.0659, -0.2008, -0.0604, -0.1322, -0.0162, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0985, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0004, -0.2292, -0.0081, -0.0, -0.0022, -0.0001, -0.4117, -0.2855, -0.0008, -0.0018, -0.588, -0.2461, -0.0026, -0.3