{"id": "54", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n* Helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by eliminating pesky germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush.\n* Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n* Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food particles from areas that brushing cannot access.\n\nTherefore, using a water pick can be an effective addition to your oral hygiene routine, complementing traditional brushing and flossing methods.", "pred": "Water picks help maintain oral health by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque, especially in areas brushing cannot reach. They massage and stimulate soft tissue to reduce gingivitis risk, clean better around teeth and gums, and remove food from inaccessible areas.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Water picks help maintain oral health by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque, especially in areas brushing cannot reach. They massage and stimulate soft tissue to reduce gingivitis risk, clean better around teeth and gums, and remove food from inaccessible areas.", "time_sec": 5.203, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 17231, 65438, 3508, 7766, 17580, 4612, 1536, 29521, 1261, 5666, 10197, 1307, 4180, 1513, 1278, 66282, 3110, 1317, 31924, 22146, 1115, 1321, 41345, 1044, 7702, 1294, 7224, 102394, 6560, 8132, 1046, 4159, 68664, 1321, 51578, 6444, 9392, 1317, 9980, 18616, 1354, 11505, 5735, 1044, 9375, 4942, 3879, 20277, 1321, 1343, 11558, 1044, 1321, 8559, 6939, 