{"id": "96", "question": "typical weather in indiana", "gt": "The typical weather in Indiana is characterized by long, warm, humid, and wet summers. The winters are chilly and windy with some snowfall. The temperature typically varies from 22°F to 85°F and is rarely below 3°F or above 92°F. The state also experiences some rainfall, with the wettest year recording 57.65 inches of rain and the driest 24.97 inches. The most snowfall recorded in a season was 74.5 inches.", "pred": "The typical weather in Indiana features long, warm, humid, and wet summers and chilly, windy winters, with temperatures ranging from 22°F to 85°F annually, rarely dropping below 3°F or exceeding 92°F, and partly cloudy conditions year-round.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: The typical weather in Indiana features long, warm, humid, and wet summers and chilly, windy winters, with temperatures ranging from 22°F to 85°F annually, rarely dropping below 3°F or exceeding 92°F, and partly cloudy conditions year-round.", "time_sec": 5.664, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 1531, 15421, 17253, 1294, 34261, 6971, 2730, 1044, 15701, 1044, 56701, 1044, 1321, 18258, 115476, 1321, 1528, 14637, 1044, 12330, 1121, 111148, 1044, 1454, 18548, 24999, 1562, 1032, 1050, 1050, 4372, 1070, 1317, 1032, 1056, 1053, 4372, 1070, 43689, 1044, 25640, 44491, 5956, 1032, 1051, 4372, 1070, 1505, 63118, 1032, 1057, 1050, 4372, 1070, 1044, 1321, 27254, 16152, 1121, 5481, 2637, 40120, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.0722, -0.0082, -1.2455, -0.0715, -0.0002, -0.0002, -0.047, -0.5328, -0.1385, -0.0, -0.0012, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0005, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.7395, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0031, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0029, -0.073, -0.0, -0.1017, -