{"id": "107", "question": "what is the difference between the leeward and windward islands?", "gt": "The Windward and Leeward Islands are part of the Lesser Antilles of the Caribbean Sea. The Windward Islands are in the southeast and are exposed to the northeast trade winds, hence they receive more rain and are wetter. On the other hand, the Leeward Islands are located in the northwest and are away from the wind, making them drier.", "pred": "The difference is that windward islands get more rain, are wetter, and are the side of the mountain closest to the ocean, while leeward islands are farther from shore, drier, and still receive some rain.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: The difference is that windward islands get more rain, are wetter, and are the side of the mountain closest to the ocean, while leeward islands are farther from shore, drier, and still receive some rain.", "time_sec": 4.349, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 1531, 6592, 1395, 1455, 12330, 2619, 33957, 2012, 2081, 17378, 1044, 1584, 18258, 1397, 1044, 1321, 1584, 1278, 4258, 1307, 1278, 24361, 31420, 1317, 1278, 27208, 1044, 3016, 1459, 2032, 1580, 33957, 1584, 57217, 1562, 46422, 1044, 1266, 6180, 1044, 1321, 3637, 10477, 2269, 17378, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.1376, -0.013, -0.0838, -1.0685, -0.6907, -0.0013, -0.0633, -0.0, -0.0033, -0.0645, -0.0, -0.0, -0.1405, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0056, -0.0038, -0.1381, -0.0037, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0141, -0.0071, -0.002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.517, -0.0, -0.0198, -0.0004, -0.0029, -0.0, -0.0174, -0.2877, -0.1777, -0.0634, -0.5504, -0.0001, -0.0161, -0.2061], "cumulative_logprob": -4.3011, "norm_l