{"id": "109", "question": "what is the difference between the leeward and windward islands?", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the Windward Islands are located in the southeastern part of the Caribbean Sea and are exposed to the wind (\"windward\") of the northeast trade winds (northeasterlies), while the Leeward Islands are located in the northwestern part of the Lesser Antilles and are away from the wind (\"lee\"). The main difference between them is their exposure to the wind and the resulting climate. The Windward Islands get more rain and are wetter due to their exposure to the wind, while the Leeward Islands are drier but still get rain.", "pred": "The difference is that windward islands get more rain, are wetter, and are the side of the mountain closest to the ocean, while leeward islands are farther from shore, drier, and still receive some rain.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: The difference is that windward islands get more rain, are wetter, and are the side of the mountain closest to the ocean, while leeward islands are farther from shore, drier, and still receive some rain.", "time_sec": 4.22, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 1531, 6592, 1395, 1455, 12330, 2619, 33957, 2012, 2081, 17378, 1044, 1584, 18258, 1397, 1044, 1321, 1584, 1278, 4258, 1307, 1278, 24361, 31420, 1317, 1278, 27208, 1044, 3016, 1459, 2032, 1580, 33957, 1584, 57217, 1562, 46422, 1044, 1266, 6180, 1044, 1321, 3637, 10477, 2269, 17378, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.1376, -0.013, -0.0838, -1.0685, -0.6907, -0.0013, -0.0633, -0.0, -0.0033, -0.0645, -0.0, -0.0, -0.1405, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0056, -0.0038, -0.1381, -0.0037, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.0,