{"id": "112", "question": "what is the difference between the leeward and windward islands?", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the main difference between the Windward Islands and the Leeward Islands is their exposure to the northeast trade winds (northeasterlies). The Windward Islands are exposed to the wind and are therefore wetter and receive more rainfall, while the Leeward Islands are away from the wind and are drier, but still receive some rainfall. Additionally, the Windward Islands are located southeast of the Caribbean Sea, while the Leeward Islands are located northwest of the Caribbean Sea.", "pred": "The difference is that windward islands get more rain, are wetter, and are the side of the mountain closest to the ocean, while leeward islands are farther from shore, drier, and still receive some rain.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: The difference is that windward islands get more rain, are wetter, and are the side of the mountain closest to the ocean, while leeward islands are farther from shore, drier, and still receive some rain.", "time_sec": 4.244, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 1531, 6592, 1395, 1455, 12330, 2619, 33957, 2012, 2081, 17378, 1044, 1584, 18258, 1397, 1044, 1321, 1584, 1278, 4258, 1307, 1278, 24361, 31420, 1317, 1278, 27208, 1044, 3016, 1459, 2032, 1580, 33957, 1584, 57217, 1562, 46422, 1044, 1266, 6180, 1044, 1321, 3637, 10477, 2269, 17378, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.1376, -0.013, -0.0838, -1.0685, -0.6907, -0.0013, -0.0633, -0.0, -0.0033, -0.0645, -0.0, -0.0, -0.1405, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0056, -0.0038, -0.1381, -0.0037, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0141, -0.0071, -0.002, -0.0, -0.