{"id": "181", "question": "psychological effects of hugging", "gt": "Hugging has physiological benefits and can have a similar effect on the body as certain drugs. It can also lead to emotional intimacy and happy relationships. Hugging and touch, even with inanimate objects, can help reduce existential fears and worry about mortality.", "pred": "Psychological hugs, as described in the passages, are achieved through the use of empathy and listening skills (empathic listening), which can lead to good relationships, emotional intimacy, and happy marriages. These skills may make a conversation partner feel as though they are receiving a hug, providing psychological comfort.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Psychological hugs, as described in the passages, are achieved through the use of empathy and listening skills (empathic listening), which can lead to good relationships, emotional intimacy, and happy marriages. These skills may make a conversation partner feel as though they are receiving a hug, providing psychological comfort.", "time_sec": 5.23, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 113489, 39638, 1115, 1044, 1435, 5055, 1294, 1278, 42679, 1044, 1584, 12955, 2645, 1278, 2210, 1307, 84329, 1321, 27575, 14627, 1319, 5636, 1682, 1290, 27575, 1574, 1799, 1710, 3820, 1317, 3683, 14608, 1044, 20120, 104720, 1044, 1321, 15015, 80183, 1046, 4634, 14627, 2188, 3180, 1261, 18106, 16025, 5389, 1435, 5572, 2127, 1584, 12946, 1261, 39638, 1044, 11495, 23690, 15710, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.0421, -0.0042, -0.6134, -0.1977, -0.1197, -0.4009, -0.3876, -0.0697, -0.0002, -0.5501, -0.574, -0.0, -0.8836, -0.3039, -0.0, -0.2346, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.0029, -0.003, -0.0, -0.47