{"id": "191", "question": "how to attach multiple picture frames together", "gt": "To attach multiple picture frames together, you can use small hinges to connect the frames. Lay the frames beside each other to determine the desired arrangement. For two frames, use identical ones, and for three frames, either choose three identical frames or use a larger one as the middle frame. Mark the hinge placement on the connecting sides of the frames, ensuring it is the same distance from the bottom edges. Attach the hinges to securely join the frames.", "pred": "To attach multiple picture frames together, use identical frames for joining two frames and either three identical frames or one larger frame in the middle for joining three frames. Lay the frames beside each other to check the effect. Place two frames back to back, mark the hinge placement at the same distance from the bottom edges of each frame to ensure secure standing on a table top, and attach two small hinges to the connecting sides of the frames.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: To attach multiple picture frames together, use identical frames for joining two frames and either three identical frames or one larger frame in the middle for joining three frames. Lay the frames beside each other to check the effect. Place two frames back to back, mark the hinge placement at the same distance from the bottom edges of each frame to ensure secure standing on a table top, and attach two small hinges to the connecting sides of the frames.", "time_sec": 7.089, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 3870, 14722, 6245, 13083, 24751, 5823, 1044, 2210, 18535, 24751, 1394, 31427, 2295, 24751, 1321, 5250, 3300, 18535, 24751, 150