{"id": "260", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "MSM powder offers several benefits. It helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, thereby increasing energy levels. It also makes cell walls more permeable. The powder aids in the absorption of more nutrients, particularly when paired with Co-enzyme Q10. Additionally, MSM powder can help relieve muscular aches and pains and reduce inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "pred": "MSM powder benefits the body by helping get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, helping absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals) and allowing co-enzyme Q10 to be fully utilized, relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: MSM powder benefits the body by helping get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, helping absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals) and allowing co-enzyme Q10 to be fully utilized, relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "time_sec": 6.462, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 13172, 1077, 22797, 15021, 1278, 4212, 1536, 22763, 2012, 14297, 2203, 1278, 6517, 2081, 34737, 1454, 1278, 2879, 5647, 1307, 2196, 1044, 8035, 6091, 5283, 1536, 6187, 2469, 16363, 2081, 27450, 1638, 1044, 22763, 24301, 2081, 48824, 1319, 28359, 1325, 2097, 1321, 55144, 1041, 1321, 15249, 2160, 15088, 15379, 2466, 1049,