{"id": "261", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "The benefits of MSM powder include helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, aiding in the absorption of nutrients, relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "pred": "MSM powder benefits the body by helping get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, helping absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals) and allowing co-enzyme Q10 to be fully utilized, relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: MSM powder benefits the body by helping get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, helping absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals) and allowing co-enzyme Q10 to be fully utilized, relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "time_sec": 6.409, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 13172, 1077, 22797, 15021, 1278, 4212, 1536, 22763, 2012, 14297, 2203, 1278, 6517, 2081, 34737, 1454, 1278, 2879, 5647, 1307, 2196, 1044, 8035, 6091, 5283, 1536, 6187, 2469, 16363, 2081, 27450, 1638, 1044, 22763, 24301, 2081, 48824, 1319, 28359, 1325, 2097, 1321, 55144, 1041, 1321, 15249, 2160, 15088, 15379, 2466, 1049, 1048, 1317, 1402, 10886, 25653, 1044, 2152, 47119, 51403, 5672, 1264, 1321, 95940, 1044, 1321, 1729