{"id": "264", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of MSM powder:\n\n1. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable and allowing nutrients to be absorbed more efficiently.\n2. Helps reduce inflammation and swelling in muscles and joints.\n3. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n4. Enhances the absorption of vitamins and minerals, including Co-enzyme Q10.\n\nNote that the passages do not mention any other specific benefits of MSM powder beyond these points.", "pred": "MSM powder benefits the body by helping get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, helping absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals) and allowing co-enzyme Q10 to be fully utilized, relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: MSM powder benefits the body by helping get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, helping absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals) and allowing co-enzyme Q10 to be fully utilized, relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "time_sec": 6.431, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 13172, 1077, 22797, 15021, 1278, 4212, 1536, 22763, 2012, 14297, 2203, 1278, 6517, 2081, 34737, 1454, 1278, 2879, 5647, 1307, 2196, 1044, 8035, 6091, 5283, 1536, 6187, 2469, 16363, 2081, 27450, 1638, 1044, 22763, 24301, 2081, 48824, 1319, 28359, 1325, 2097