{"id": "380", "question": "what is dmso used for", "gt": "Based on the given passages, DMSO is used for various purposes, including:\n\n1. Industrial uses: As an antifreeze and solvent for a wide range of chemicals.\n2. Medical uses: To relieve pain, reduce swelling and inflammation, promote healing, and treat a variety of medical ailments such as burns, scleroderma, and soft tissue damage.\n3. Pain relief: For muscles and joints, and as a general pain reliever applied to the skin.\n4. Skin care: To penetrate skin and tissue and enter the bloodstream.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"What is DMSO used for?\" can be summarized as: DMSO is used for various industrial, medical, and personal care purposes, including pain relief, wound healing, and skin care.", "pred": "DMSO is used as an antifreeze, a solvent for a wide range of chemicals, and in medicine for pain relief, reducing swelling and inflammation, and promoting healing of minor cuts, burns, soft tissue damage, skin ulcers, and burns.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: DMSO is used as an antifreeze, a solvent for a wide range of chemicals, and in medicine for pain relief, reducing swelling and inflammation, and promoting healing of minor cuts, burns, soft tissue damage, skin ulcers, and burns.", "time_sec": 4.361, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 66300, 1395, 2434, 1435, 1420, 65223, 53443, 1044, 1261, 19878, 1394, 1261, 9924, 4521, 1307, 41135, 1044, 1321, 1294, 21527, 1394, 6890, 20081, 1044, 17291, 53498, 1321, 21955, 1044, 1321, 29905, 29288, 1307, 11154, 39985, 1044, 81126, 1044, 6444, 9392, 10605, 1044, 9877, 111135, 1044, 1321, 81126, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.2336, -0.0026, -0.1718, 