{"id": "400", "question": "temperature bucharest", "gt": "Based on passage 3, the average temperature in Bucharest, Romania during July and August is around 23 °C (73 °F). Temperatures can also reach 35 °C (95 °F) to 40 °C (104 °F) in mid-summer.", "pred": "The temperature in Bucharest can dip below 0 °C (32 °F) in winter, sometimes reaching as low as minus 20 °C (4 °F), while summer temperatures average around 23 °C (73 °F) and can reach 35 °C (95 °F) to 40 °C (104 °F) in mid-summer.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: The temperature in Bucharest can dip below 0 °C (32 °F) in winter, sometimes reaching as low as minus 20 °C (4 °F), while summer temperatures average around 23 °C (73 °F) and can reach 35 °C (95 °F) to 40 °C (104 °F) in mid-summer.", "time_sec": 6.787, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 1531, 6138, 1294, 130632, 1710, 15018, 5956, 1032, 1048, 6885, 1067, 1319, 1051, 1050, 6885, 1070, 1041, 1294, 18976, 1044, 10463, 22538, 1435, 4253, 1435, 38618, 1032, 1050, 1048, 6885, 1067, 1319, 1052, 6885, 1070, 1574, 3016, 14719, 18548, 6931, 3879, 1032, 1050, 1051, 6885, 1067, 1319, 1055, 1051, 6885, 1070, 1041, 1321, 1710, 8132, 1032, 1051, 1053, 6885, 1067, 1319, 1057, 1053, 6885, 1070, 1041, 1317, 1032, 1052, 1048, 6885, 1067, 1319, 1049, 1048, 1052, 6885, 1070, 1041, 1294, 8364, 2553, 63064, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.1353, -0.0013, -1.3078, -0.5255, -0.0044, -0.0, -0.6613, -0.9329, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.415, -0.0, -0.2594, -0.002, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0629, -0.0093, -0.0005, -0.3148, -0.0067, -0.0354, -0.2745, -0.0, -0.0, -0.1659, -0.0026, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.3164, -0.3661, -0.1887, -0.8352, -0.071, -0.005