{"id": "412", "question": "how do i breed a shugabeats in my singing monsters", "gt": "To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you must first obtain the Shugabush Monster from another island. This will turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg. After hatching them, buy the breeding structure. Then, use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats monster. The order of the monsters does not matter.", "pred": "To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island. Then, turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg, hatch them, and buy the breeding structure. Finally, breed the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats monster.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island. Then, turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg, hatch them, and buy the breeding structure. Finally, breed the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats monster.", "time_sec": 6.599, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 3870, 50309, 1261, 3073, 1936, 5337, 2476, 1294, 4890, 8139, 1302, 116468, 1044, 1636, 2534, 1317, 4800, 1278, 3073, 1936, 1401, 3506, 59113, 1562, 1278, 2147, 17453, 1046, 6830, 1044, 3884, 2143, 3073, 1936, 1401, 3506, 116468, 2203, 1420, 19121, 1044, 74494, 2424, 1044, 1321, 14688, 1278, 40784, 5194, 1046, 15513, 1044, 50309, 1278, 3073, 1936, 1401, 3506, 1321, 1278, 52564, 114142, 1294, 1278, 3073, 1936, 1401, 3506, 11854, 40784, 5194, 1317, 2012, 1278, 3073, 1936, 5337, 2476, 44207, 