{"id": "464", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of cupping massage:\n\n* Eliminates toxins\n* Improves circulation\n* Provides pain relief\n* Reduces inflammation\n* Has therapeutic benefits such as reducing anxiety and depression\n\nAccording to the passages, cupping massage can help remove toxins from the body, increase blood flow, relieve pain, and have a positive impact on mental well-being.", "pred": "Cupping massage benefits include eliminating toxins from the body, improving circulation, providing pain relief by reducing tissue inflammation (which can increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain), and offering mental benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Cupping massage benefits include eliminating toxins from the body, improving circulation, providing pain relief by reducing tissue inflammation (which can increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain), and offering mental benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression.", "time_sec": 4.333, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 10888, 13633, 68664, 15021, 4626, 58590, 86869, 1562, 1278, 4212, 1044, 24024, 27664, 1044, 11495, 6890, 20081, 1536, 17291, 9392, 21955, 1319, 11018, 1710, 5597, 4521, 1307, 12968, 1044, 10591, 34565, 1044, 1321, 3119, 6890, 1574, 1321, 23447, 12957, 15021, 2516, 1435, 31040, 21896, 1321, 18596, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.1392, -0.0841, -1.244, -0.0, -0.0068, -0.0919, -0.0072, -0.1075, -0.0, -0.4524, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0115, -0.0714, -0.3314, -0.1098, -0.0659, -0.0, -0.0, -0.1378, -0.0002, -0.2242, 0.0, -0.1868, -0.0009, -0.