{"id": "469", "question": "benefits of hiking as a hobby facts", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of hiking as a hobby:\n\n1. Outdoor hiking promotes mental health (Passage 1).\n2. Hiking can help increase your levels of vitamin D through exposure to sunshine (Passage 2).\n3. Hiking has a positive impact on combating symptoms of stress and anxiety (Passage 3).\n\nTherefore, the main benefits of hiking as a hobby are its positive effects on mental health, physical health, and stress reduction.", "pred": "Outdoor hiking offers numerous benefits for both body and mind, is inexpensive and accessible to all fitness levels, promotes mental health through varied exercise compared to gym activities, increases vitamin D levels via sun exposure, supports cardiovascular health by reducing heart disease risk and improving fitness, and combats stress and anxiety by connecting individuals with nature, as noted by Gregory A. Miller of the American Hiking Society.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Outdoor hiking offers numerous benefits for both body and mind, is inexpensive and accessible to all fitness levels, promotes mental health through varied exercise compared to gym activities, increases vitamin D levels via sun exposure, supports cardiovascular health by reducing heart disease risk and improving fitness, and combats stress and anxiety by connecting individuals with nature, as noted by Gregory A. Miller of the American Hiking Society.", "time_sec": 6.297, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 129351, 111259, 14980, 15159, 15021, 1394, 2960, 4212, 1321, 5759, 1044, 1395, 82646, 1321, 23885, 1317, 1747, 32682, 5283, 1044, 39793, 12957, 4612, 2645