{"id": "481", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked if you have used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The company does not guarantee your security when using these apps and may send you a warning message before locking your account. If you have been warned multiple times and continue using third-party apps, your account may remain locked.", "pred": "Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party applications to access Snapchat, which violates Snapchat's security policies and puts your account at risk of being locked.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party applications to access Snapchat, which violates Snapchat's security policies and puts your account at risk of being locked.", "time_sec": 3.653, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 9825, 97700, 11274, 5449, 1395, 39833, 27812, 3147, 1636, 2434, 5888, 49209, 10792, 1317, 4731, 97700, 11274, 1044, 1799, 6938, 2130, 97700, 11274, 1681, 10098, 17973, 1321, 27846, 2143, 5449, 1513, 5735, 1307, 3144, 27812, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.1447, -0.0023, -0.0904, -0.0011, -0.0001, -0.1809, -0.1702, -0.1171, -0.0, -0.0553, -0.0163, -0.0779, -0.2355, -0.6391, -0.1839, -0.0398, -0.0001, -0.4961, -0.0, -0.1761, -0.0118, -0.0263, -0.0, -0.1366, -0.0, -0.1787, -0.8993, -0.0023, -0.4928, -1.0231, -0.1998, -0.0179, -0.5752, -0.0001, -0.9309, -0.1526, -0.2041, -0.395, -0.8987], "cumulative_logprob": -8.7721, "norm_logp": -0.2193, "input_len": 582, "output_tokens": 40, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 41.18, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "482", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the given passages, Snapchat may temporarily lock an account if the user has been using third-party applications to access the app. These third-party apps can compromise the security of the account and put the user and their friends at risk. Snapchat may send a warning message before locking the account, but if the user continues to use third-party apps, their account may be locked.", "pred": "Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party applications to access Snapchat, which violates Snapchat's security policies and puts your account at risk of being locked.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party applications to access Snapchat, which violates Snapchat's security policies and puts your account at risk of being locked.", "time_sec": 3.59, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 9825, 97700, 11274, 5449, 1395, 39833, 27812, 3147, 1636, 2434, 5888, 49209, 10792, 1317, 4731, 97700, 11274, 1044, 1799, 6938, 2130, 97700, 11274, 1681, 10098, 17973, 1321, 27846, 2143, 5449, 1513, 5735, 1307, 3144, 27812, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.1447, -0.0023, -0.0904, -0.0011, -0.0001, -0.1809, -0.1702, -0.1171, -0.0, -0.0553, -0.0163, -0.0779, -0.2355, -0.6391, -0.1839, -0.0398, -0.0001, -0.4961, -0.0, -0.1761, -0.0118, -0.0263, -0.0, -0.1366, -0.0, -0.1787, -0.8993, -0.0023, -0.4928, -1.0231, -0.1998, -0.0179, -0.5752, -0.0001, -0.9309, -0.1526, -0.2041, -0.395, -0.8987], "cumulative_logprob": -8.7721, "norm_logp": -0.2193, "input_len": 582, "output_tokens": 40, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 33.33, "GAVIE-R