{"id": "483", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the given passages, it appears that Snapchat may lock accounts that use third-party applications to access the platform more than four times. If a user has been locked out of their account and doesn't know why, using third-party apps may be a reason. Third-party apps are applications that are not developed or officially supported by Snapchat, such as third-party messaging or camera apps. Using these apps may put the user's account at risk, as well as their friends'. Additionally, there are many reasons why people are getting locked out of Snapchat, including using third-party apps.", "pred": "Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party applications to access Snapchat, which violates Snapchat's security policies and puts your account at risk of being locked.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party applications to access Snapchat, which violates Snapchat's security policies and puts your account at risk of being locked.", "time_sec": 3.517, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 9825, 97700, 11274, 5449, 1395, 39833, 27812, 3147, 1636, 2434, 5888, 49209, 10792, 1317, 4731, 97700, 11274, 1044, 1799, 6938, 2130, 97700, 11274, 1681, 10098, 17973, 1321, 27846, 2143, 5449, 1513, 5735, 1307, 3144, 27812, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.1447, -0.0023, -0.0904, -0.0011, -0.0001, -0.1809, -0.1702, -0.1171, -0.0, -0.0553, -0.0163, -0.0779, -0.2355, -0.6391, -0.1839, -0.0398, -0.0001, -0.4961, -0.0, -0.1761, -0.0118, -0.0263, -0.0, -0.1366, -0.0, -0.1787, -0.8993, -0.0023, -0.4928, -1.0231, -0.1998, -0.0