{"id": "484", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here is why your Snapchat account might be temporarily locked:\n\n1. Using third-party apps to access Snapchat without authorization: According to passage 2, Snapchat does not guarantee the security of accounts accessed through third-party apps. If you have been using such apps, it could result in your account being locked.\n2. Exceeding the limit of warnings for third-party app usage: Passage 1 mentions that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts that use third-party apps excessively. If you have exceeded the limit of warnings, your account might be temporarily locked.\n\nTherefore, the most likely reason for your Snapchat account being temporarily locked is due to the unauthorized use of third-party apps.", "pred": "Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party applications to access Snapchat, which violates Snapchat's security policies and puts your account at risk of being locked.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party applications to access Snapchat, which violates Snapchat's security policies and puts your account at risk of being locked.", "time_sec": 3.606, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 9825, 97700, 11274, 5449, 1395, 39833, 27812, 3147, 1636, 2434, 5888, 49209, 10792, 1317, 4731, 97700, 11274, 1044, 1799, 6938, 2130, 97700, 11274, 1681, 10098, 17973, 1321, 27846, 2143, 5449, 1513, 5735, 1307, 3144, 27812, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.1447, -0.0023, -0.0904, -0.0011, -0.0001, -0.1809, -0.1702, -0.1171, -0.0, -0.0553, -0.0163, -0.0779, -0.235