{"id": "485", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, it appears that your Snapchat account has been temporarily locked due to using third-party apps. According to passage 2, Snapchat does not guarantee security when using third-party apps, and they may lock your account if they detect such usage. Passage 3 also mentions that Snapchat has taken steps to punish individuals who use third-party apps, which could result in account lockout.\n\nIt's possible that you have been warned multiple times by Snapchat about using third-party apps, as mentioned in passage 1, and your account has been locked as a result. To regain access to your account, you may need to stop using third-party apps and wait for an official Snapchat app to become available for your device, as suggested in passage 2.", "pred": "Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party applications to access Snapchat, which violates Snapchat's security policies and puts your account at risk of being locked.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party applications to access Snapchat, which violates Snapchat's security policies and puts your account at risk of being locked.", "time_sec": 3.552, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 9825, 97700, 11274, 5449, 1395, 39833, 27812, 3147, 1636, 2434, 5888, 49209, 10792, 1317, 4731, 97700, 11274, 1044, 1799, 6938, 2130, 97700, 11274, 1681, 10098, 17973, 1321, 27846, 2143, 5449, 1513, 5735, 1307, 3144, 27812, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.1447, -0.0023, -0.0904, -0.0011, -0.0001, -0.1809, -0.1702, -0.1171, -0.0, -0.0553, -0.0163, -0