{"id": "504", "question": "what are the characteristics of tropical rainforest floor", "gt": "The floor of a tropical rainforest biome is characterized by a fast rate of decay due to the heat and moisture. This decay provides rich nutrients for other plants to grow. Various types of fruits, nuts, herbs, and mushrooms grow on the rainforest floor. Additionally, vines and ferns grow all over the rainforest, including the floor, helping to connect the various layers of the biome.", "pred": "The tropical rainforest floor features herbs and mushrooms that grow there, along with vines and ferns that help connect the various layers of the biome. Bananas also grow on vines in this biome. Due to the heat and moisture, plants and animals that die in this location rot quickly, and their decay provides rich nutrients for other plants to grow from.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: The tropical rainforest floor features herbs and mushrooms that grow there, along with vines and ferns that help connect the various layers of the biome. Bananas also grow on vines in this biome. Due to the heat and moisture, plants and animals that die in this location rot quickly, and their decay provides rich nutrients for other plants to grow from.", "time_sec": 6.069, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 1531, 24170, 17378, 106761, 11237, 6971, 81991, 1321, 125404, 1455, 4492, 2156, 1044, 4837, 1454, 1330, 2783, 1321, 1284, 63786, 1455, 3508, 8044, 1278, 5561, 14953, 1307, 1278, 105789, 1046, 20251, 16008, 2095, 4492, 1408, 1330, 2783, 1294, 1593, 105789, 1046, 22587, 1317, 1278, 9374, 1321, 39493, 1044, 12474, 1321, 11115, 1455, 1828, 1294, 1593, 7285, 6554, 10533, 1044, 1321, 2034, 32027, 8222,