{"id": "522", "question": "temperature for tallahassee florida", "gt": "Tallahassee, Florida has an overall average high temperature of 79 degrees and an average low of 56 degrees. Freezing temperatures can sporadically occur from November to March, with two or three nights on average even dropping to 20 °F or lower.", "pred": "The average high temperature in Tallahassee, Florida is 79 degrees, and the average low temperature is 56 degrees. Freezing temperatures occur sporadically from November to March, with two or three nights on average dropping to 20 °F (-8 °C) or lower. Tallahassee can experience a day when the temperature never rises above 32 °F, though this is a rare event that typically occurs just once a decade.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: The average high temperature in Tallahassee, Florida is 79 degrees, and the average low temperature is 56 degrees. Freezing temperatures occur sporadically from November to March, with two or three nights on average dropping to 20 °F (-8 °C) or lower. Tallahassee can experience a day when the temperature never rises above 32 °F, though this is a rare event that typically occurs just once a decade.", "time_sec": 7.615, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 1531, 6931, 2738, 6138, 1294, 33739, 1816, 1288, 6270, 1044, 17940, 1395, 1032, 1055, 1057, 17633, 1044, 1321, 1278, 6931, 4253, 6138, 1395, 1032, 1053, 1054, 17633, 1046, 16611, 33542, 18548, 7260, 32330, 1332, 2981, 1562, 6032, 1317, 6346, 1044, 1454, 2295, 1505, 3300, 43724, 1408, 6931, 44491, 1317, 1032, 1050, 1048, 6885, 1070, 17522, 1056, 6885, 1067, 1041, 1505, 4953, 1046, 33739, 1816, 1288, 6270, 1710, 7061, 1261, 3950, 2200, 1278, 6138, 4772, 55705, 4455, 1