{"id": "533", "question": "what are safety pins in a first aid box used for", "gt": "Based on the given passages, safety pins in a first aid box are used for various purposes such as immobilizing an injured arm, securing a bandana over a bleeding wound, and helping to keep a severe wound closed. Additionally, safety pins can be used to remove splinters in the wilderness.", "pred": "Safety pins in a first aid box are used for immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling, securing a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg, helping keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances, and removing splinters.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Safety pins in a first aid box are used for immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling, securing a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg, helping keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances, and removing splinters.", "time_sec": 5.967, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 40035, 44685, 1294, 1261, 2158, 17217, 7616, 1584, 2434, 1394, 45950, 7415, 1420, 5882, 1536, 14086, 2588, 1278, 71087, 1307, 1261, 2730, 41703, 30235, 1317, 2246, 15448, 1317, 20023, 1261, 7510, 82994, 5882, 2876, 1302, 1044, 54978, 1261, 5287, 3088, 2136, 1261, 34997, 1321, 33484, 5882, 1505, 3823, 1044, 22763, 5807, 1261, 13015, 17084, 9323, 1294, 3535, 1307, 81666, 1264, 1294, 2520, 20153, 1044, 1321, 23771, 15070, 3586, 1115, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.4454, -0.0605, -0.0999, -0.0001, -0.0752, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0018, -0.0116, -0.0562, -0.0, -0.4216, -0.1426, -0.0, -0.