{"id": "571", "question": "how to do the skill moves on fifa 16 for xbox one", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here is how to perform skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing): Press and hold the LT button on the Xbox controller, followed by a quick tap of the RB button.\n\nThat's it! This combination will allow you to perform the ball juggling skill move while standing on the field in FIFA 16 on Xbox One.", "pred": "To do skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, use the button combination LT (hold) + RB (tap) for the Ball Juggle (while standing) skill move, as specified for Xbox 360 & Xbox One consoles and PC with a controller in the passage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: To do skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, use the button combination LT (hold) + RB (tap) for the Ball Juggle (while standing) skill move, as specified for Xbox 360 & Xbox One consoles and PC with a controller in the passage.", "time_sec": 5.111, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 3870, 1653, 21762, 20183, 1408, 23711, 1032, 1049, 1054, 1394, 46411, 5661, 1044, 2210, 1278, 8305, 9943, 55021, 1319, 8681, 1041, 1867, 42827, 1319, 115344, 1041, 1394, 1278, 17792, 21992, 9667, 1319, 10184, 15866, 1041, 21762, 6920, 1044, 1435, 12581, 1394, 46411, 1032, 1051, 1054, 1048, 1748, 46411, 5661, 120633, 1321, 8001, 1454, 1261, 10979, 1294, 1278, 14456, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.1053, -0.0024, -0.4375, -0.6718, -0.0081, -0.0, -0.0252, -0.0012, -0.0061, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0137, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.0023, -0.1235, -0.1119, -0.1843, -0.0652, -0.0293, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0009, -0.6432, -0.2523, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.6588, -0.0, -0.0, -0.617,