{"id": "572", "question": "how to do the skill moves on fifa 16 for xbox one", "gt": "Sure, I can help you with that! Based on the given passages, here's how to do skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing): Hold LT + tap RB.\n\nNote that this combination works for Xbox 360 and Xbox One controllers. If you're playing on PC with a controller, the buttons may be different. Additionally, there are tutorial videos available online that show what each skill move looks like, which can be helpful in mastering these moves.", "pred": "To do skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, use the button combination LT (hold) + RB (tap) for the Ball Juggle (while standing) skill move, as specified for Xbox 360 & Xbox One consoles and PC with a controller in the passage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: To do skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, use the button combination LT (hold) + RB (tap) for the Ball Juggle (while standing) skill move, as specified for Xbox 360 & Xbox One consoles and PC with a controller in the passage.", "time_sec": 5.1, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 3870, 1653, 21762, 20183, 1408, 23711, 1032, 1049, 1054, 1394, 46411, 5661, 1044, 2210, 1278, 8305, 9943, 55021, 1319, 8681, 1041, 1867, 42827, 1319, 115344, 1041, 1394, 1278, 17792, 21992, 9667, 1319, 10184, 15866, 1041, 21762, 6920, 1044, 1435, 12581, 1394, 46411, 1032, 1051, 1054, 1048, 1748, 46411, 5661, 120633, 1321, 8001, 1454, 1261, 10979, 1294, 1278, 14456, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.1053, -0.0024, -0.4375, -0.6718, -0.0081, -0.0, -0.0252, -0.0012, -0.0061, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0137, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.0023, -0.1235, -0.1119, -0.1843, -0.0652, -0.0293, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0