{"id": "576", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are some ways to quickly get rid of mice:\n\n1. Take immediate action to get rid of mice as soon as possible, as they can quickly take up residence in your home and start nesting (Passage 1).\n2. Seal off all entry points into your home, including holes around pipes and vents, using steel wool to prevent mice from getting back in (Passage 2).\n3. Get rid of any sources of food for mice and rats, as they will quickly take advantage of any food left behind by humans (Passage 3).\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages. The passages do not provide specific instructions on how to quickly get rid of mice once they have entered a home.", "pred": "Take immediate action to get rid of mice quickly, as they can rapidly take up residence and start nesting in your home.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Take immediate action to get rid of mice quickly, as they can rapidly take up residence and start nesting in your home.", "time_sec": 2.663, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 25126, 20726, 5263, 1317, 2012, 15515, 1307, 9425, 10533, 1044, 1435, 2127, 1710, 18747, 4069, 2015, 31202, 1321, 3030, 100223, 1294, 2143, 4590, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.0437, -0.0056, -1.0748, -0.0003, -0.0001, -0.1734, -0.4005, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0128, -0.015, -0.0103, -0.0021, -0.3788, -0.0002, -0.003, -0.0772, -0.0044, 0.0, -0.0006, -0.0924, -0.0, -0.8437, -0.0253, -0.0, -0.0543, -0.151], "cumulative_logprob": -3.3695, "norm_logp": -0.1203, "input_len": 333, "output_tokens": 28, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.32, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "580", "question": "what do i do if i got my sperrys wet", "gt": "Based on the given passages, if your Sperry shoes get wet, it is recommended to use a leather conditioner to help revitalize the leather and infuse moisture back into it. This is especially important if you wash your shoes with detergent, as it tends to dry out the leather. If you don't have a leather conditioner on hand, you can use a suede bar or leather brush to clean the shoes. It's best to avoid getting light tan Sperry shoes wet, as water might stain them. However, if you do get them wet, using a suede bar or leather brush should help remove any stains.", "pred": "If your Sperry shoes get wet, you can reassemble them after washing with detergent and using a leather conditioner to revitalize the leather, as stated in passage 1. For light tan Sperry shoes, be cautious of potential water stains, as mentioned in passage 2. To clean stains, consider using a suede bar and leather brush, which are affordable at $5-$10, as suggested in passage 3.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: If your Sperry shoes get wet, you can reassemble them after washing with detergent and using a leather conditioner to revitalize the leather, as stated in passage 1. For light tan Sperry shoes, be cautious of potential water stains, as mentioned in passage 2. To clean stains, consider using a suede bar and leather brush, which are affordable at $5-$10, as suggested in passage 3.", "time_sec": 7.127, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 3367, 2143, 86376, 1938, 35023, 2012, 18258, 1044, 1636, 1710, 38669, 8869, 2424, 2453, 36278, 1454, 105396, 1321, 2505, 1261, 38892, 6570, 1258, 1317, 108902, 2033, 1278, 38892, 1044, 143