{"id": "620", "question": "how has it technology changed the workplace", "gt": "IT technology has significantly changed the workplace in several ways. It has improved efficiency and increased productivity, as it allows for a complete shift in how time is spent in the modern workplace. The continuous evolution of technology also changes how business is conducted and the dynamics of the workplace. Over the last 10 to 15 years, technology has drastically changed attitudes and processes in the workplace. Technology has also dramatically reshaped the average American workplace, allowing employees to interact with a global market and take work on the road.", "pred": "Technology has changed the workplace by increasing efficiency and productivity, transforming business dynamics and workplace attitudes, enabling global market interaction, and allowing employees to work remotely.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Technology has changed the workplace by increasing efficiency and productivity, transforming business dynamics and workplace attitudes, enabling global market interaction, and allowing employees to work remotely.", "time_sec": 3.142, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 19243, 1934, 8533, 1278, 52608, 1536, 8035, 13873, 1321, 36249, 1044, 61502, 6170, 20991, 1321, 52608, 32597, 1044, 36186, 7783, 7232, 10613, 1044, 1321, 15249, 17942, 1317, 2196, 72467, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.3096, -0.0075, -0.7111, -0.001, -0.1682, -0.0004, -0.0019, -0.3925, -0.2368, -0.0006, -0.0181, -0.0002, -0.0644, -0.3933, -0.0414, -0.0881, -0.4795, -0.1355, -0.0385, -0.6959, -0.7176, -0.0508, -0.6862, -0.0038, -0.0025, -0.0626, -0.1301, -0.0417, -0.0, -0.0006, -0.0003, -0.2511, -0.3374], "cumulative_logprob": -6.0692, "norm_logp": -0.1785, "input_len": 320, "output_tokens": 34, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 38.46, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "625", "question": "how has it technology changed the workplace", "gt": "Based on the given passages, technology has changed the workplace in several ways, including:\n\n1. Increased efficiency and productivity: Technology has enabled automation of many tasks, allowing employees to focus on more complex and creative work, leading to increased productivity.\n2. Changes in workplace dynamics: Technology has transformed the way people communicate and collaborate in the workplace, enabling remote work and virtual teams.\n3. Rapid advancements: Technology has rapidly advanced in recent years, allowing employees to access new tools and resources, and adapt to changing market conditions.\n4. Global connectivity: Technology has enabled employees to interact with a global market and work remotely, allowing for greater flexibility and mobility.\n\nTherefore, technology has had a significant impact on the modern workplace, transforming the way people work, communicate, and collaborate.", "pred": "Technology has changed the workplace by increasing efficiency and productivity, transforming business dynamics and workplace attitudes, enabling global market interaction, and allowing employees to work remotely.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Technology has changed the workplace by increasing efficiency and productivity, transforming business dynamics and workplace attitudes, enabling global market interaction, and allowing employees to work remotely.", "time_sec": 3.05, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 19243, 1934, 8533, 1278, 52608, 1536, 8035, 13873, 1321, 36249, 1044, 61502, 6170, 20991, 1321, 52608, 32597, 1044, 36186, 7783, 7232, 10613, 1044, 1321, 15249, 17942, 1