{"id": "628", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "gt": "To guard a tall person in basketball, you can stay as close as possible to them near the three-point line, actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent, and minimize shot opportunities. Additionally, you can keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player and defend against them with tips from an experienced basketball player.", "pred": "To guard a tall person in basketball, stay as close as possible to them near the three-point line, actively slide your feet side to side to stay near and minimize shot opportunities, and keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: To guard a tall person in basketball, stay as close as possible to them near the three-point line, actively slide your feet side to side to stay near and minimize shot opportunities, and keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.", "time_sec": 4.304, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 3870, 10482, 1261, 18260, 2965, 1294, 36728, 1044, 8855, 1435, 6231, 1435, 4171, 1317, 2424, 6117, 1278, 3300, 25185, 3110, 1044, 34898, 25709, 2143, 10509, 4258, 1317, 4258, 1317, 8855, 6117, 1321, 33945, 12800, 20567, 1044, 1321, 5807, 1261, 78739, 2396, 1278, 24302, 1321, 1278, 32797, 7398, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.0121, -0.0025, -0.597, -0.0089, -0.0, -0.0, -0.002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.2664, -0.5494, 0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0383, -0.0962, -0.0778, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0158, -0.0, -0.3839, -0.0305, -0.0033, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.6594, -0.0105, -0.0004, -0.1027, -1.2166, -0.0508, -1.0191, -0.6677, -0.507, -0.0023, -0.0016, -0.0336, -0.0902, -0.0, -0.0