{"id": "630", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here is how to guard a tall person in basketball:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall, skilled shooter when guarding them near the three-point line.\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against a tall player.\n\nTherefore, to guard a tall person in basketball, it is essential to stay close to them, move quickly laterally to maintain position, and use a defensive strategy such as keeping a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.", "pred": "To guard a tall person in basketball, stay as close as possible to them near the three-point line, actively slide your feet side to side to stay near and minimize shot opportunities, and keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: To guard a tall person in basketball, stay as close as possible to them near the three-point line, actively slide your feet side to side to stay near and minimize shot opportunities, and keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.", "time_sec": 4.337, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 3870, 10482, 1261, 18260, 2965, 1294, 36728, 1044, 8855, 1435, 6231, 1435, 4171, 1317, 2424, 6117, 1278, 3300, 25185, 3110, 1044, 34898, 25709, 2143, 10509, 4258, 1317, 4258, 1317, 8855, 6117, 1321, 33945, 12800, 20567, 1044, 1321, 5807, 1261, 78739, 2396, 1278, 24302, 1321, 1278, 32797, 7398, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.0121, -0.0025, -0.597, -0.0089, -0.0, -0.0, -0.002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0004, -0