{"id": "637", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Jalapenos have numerous health benefits due to their capsaicin content. They have pain-killing properties and can serve as a natural nasal decongestant. They may also aid in weight loss and prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and possibly even cancer. Additionally, jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. They can also help increase cardiovascular health and defend heart health.", "pred": "Jalapeños offer several health benefits, including pain relief due to their capsaicin content, serving as a spicy weight loss alternative, acting as a natural nasal decongestant, potentially preventing heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, and providing essential vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. They are particularly beneficial for cardiovascular health, helping to defend against heart attacks, strokes, and high blood pressure.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Jalapeños offer several health benefits, including pain relief due to their capsaicin content, serving as a spicy weight loss alternative, acting as a natural nasal decongestant, potentially preventing heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, and providing essential vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. They are particularly beneficial for cardiovascular health, helping to defend against heart attacks, strokes, and high blood pressure.", "time_sec": 6.763, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 1507, 4182, 1446, 6840, 6266, 4631, 4612, 15021, 1044, 3907, 6890, 20081, 3964, 1317, 2034, 2735, 7839, 45213, 4701, 1044, 21892, 1435, 1261, 1942, 5794, 5954, 6410, 11559, 1044, 20544, 1435, 1261, 6967, 45941, 1311, 1590, 8865, 1450, 1044, 18