{"id": "639", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Based on the given passages, jalapeños have various health benefits such as pain relief, weight loss, nasal decongestion, prevention of heart disease and even cancer, being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, they have cardiovascular health benefits.", "pred": "Jalapeños offer several health benefits, including pain relief due to their capsaicin content, serving as a spicy weight loss alternative, acting as a natural nasal decongestant, potentially preventing heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, and providing essential vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. They are particularly beneficial for cardiovascular health, helping to defend against heart attacks, strokes, and high blood pressure.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Jalapeños offer several health benefits, including pain relief due to their capsaicin content, serving as a spicy weight loss alternative, acting as a natural nasal decongestant, potentially preventing heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, and providing essential vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. They are particularly beneficial for cardiovascular health, helping to defend against heart attacks, strokes, and high blood pressure.", "time_sec": 6.76, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 1507, 4182, 1446, 6840, 6266, 4631, 4612, 15021, 1044, 3907, 6890, 20081, 3964, 1317, 2034, 2735, 7839, 45213, 4701, 1044, 21892, 1435, 1261, 1942, 5794, 5954, 6410, 11559, 1044, 20544, 1435, 1261, 6967, 45941, 1311, 1590, 8865, 1450, 1044, 18191, 29449, 7008, 6137, 1044, 7008, 6663, 1044, 1321, 6742, 1044, 1321, 11495, 9703, 93149, 1044, 55144, 1044, 1321, 99381, 1046,