{"id": "640", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some health benefits of jalapenos:\n\n* Pain relief\n* Weight loss\n* Natural nasal decongestant\n* May help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and cancer\n* Good source of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants\n* Cardiovascular health benefits, including defending against heart health concerns and increasing cardiovascular health benefits.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"What are the health benefits of jalapenos?\" can be summarized as:\n\n* Pain relief\n* Weight loss\n* Nasal decongestant\n* Anti-cancer properties\n* Cardiovascular health benefits\n* Rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "pred": "Jalapeños offer several health benefits, including pain relief due to their capsaicin content, serving as a spicy weight loss alternative, acting as a natural nasal decongestant, potentially preventing heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, and providing essential vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. They are particularly beneficial for cardiovascular health, helping to defend against heart attacks, strokes, and high blood pressure.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Jalapeños offer several health benefits, including pain relief due to their capsaicin content, serving as a spicy weight loss alternative, acting as a natural nasal decongestant, potentially preventing heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, and providing essential vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. They are particularly beneficial for cardiovascular health, helping to defend against heart attacks, strokes, and high blood pressure.", "time_sec": 6.717, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 3110