{"id": "655", "question": "how to properly clean your hair", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are the steps to properly clean your hair:\n\n1. Rinse your hair completely with warm water, then use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair (Passage 1, step 6).\n2. Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type, and apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo into the palm of your hand while in the shower (Passage 2, steps 1-3). Work the shampoo through your hair without piling it up on your head, and avoid tangling it while it's still wet.\n3. After applying shampoo, rinse your hair thoroughly with warm water, and then comb through it with your fingers to remove any remaining tangles (Passage 1, step 7).\n4. Apply a conditioner to your hair, allowing it to remain on for a few minutes before rinsing it out with cool water (Passage 1, step 8).\n5. To dry your hair, gently pat it with a towel or wrap it around your head to absorb excess water, avoiding rubbing it vigorously with a towel (Passage 3).\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages. The passages do not provide instructions on how to style or dry your hair after cleaning it.", "pred": "To properly clean your hair, first select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type. Wet your hair with warm (not too hot) water in the shower, then apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo to your palm and work it through your hair, using your fingers to comb through longer hair and reduce tangles. Rinse the hair completely, and if it is longer, use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair. Apply conditioner in the same manner as shampoo, allow it to remain on for a few minutes, then rinse with cool water and comb through again. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing back and forth or in circles to prevent damage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: To properly clean your hair, first select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type. Wet your hair with warm (not too hot) water in the shower, then apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo to your palm and work it through your hair, using your fingers to comb through longer hair and reduce tangles. Rinse the hair completely, and if it is longer, use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair. Apply conditioner in the same manner as shampoo, allow it to remain on for a few minutes, then rinse with cool water and comb through again. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing back and forth or in circles to prevent damage.", "time_sec": 11.863, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 3870, 17103, 9375, 2143, 10188, 1044, 2158, 5762, 1278, 3875, 1627, 2372, 12078, 1321, 6570, 1258, 1394, 2143, 10188, 2658, 1046, 66195, 2143, 10188, 1454, 15701, 1319, 3715, 4382, 8480, 1041, 4180, 1294, 1278, 37809, 1044, 2430, 11145, 1261, 52718, 41720, 5647, 1307, 1627, 2372, 12078, 1317, 2143, 36631, 1321, 2196, 1494, 2645, 2143, 10188, 1044, 2505, 2143, 17296, 1317, 3830, 2645, 7934, 10188, 1321, 9980, 19953, 2013, 1046, 65117, 1415, 1278, 10188, 10185, 1044, 1321, 1693, 1494, 1395, 7934, 1044, 2210, 1261, 9924, 6793, 2279, 3830, 1317, 8559, 19953, 2013, 1321, 17208, 1278, 10188, 1046, 63882, 6570, 1258, 1294, 1278, 2879, 11665, 1435, 1627, 2372, 12078, 1044, 3894, 1494, 1317, 10399, 1408, 1394, 1261, 4517, 7334, 1044, 2430, 38124, 1415, 1454, 12921, 4180, 1321, 3830, 2645, 2790, 1046, 63322, 1278, 10188, 1454, 1261, 74537, 2505, 1261, 2350, 3333, 1505, 69956, 1302, 12968, 1044, 40052, 77487, 2595, 1321, 19888, 1505, 1294, 35438, 1317, 7495, 10605, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.0802, -0.0106, -0.3271, -0.007