{"id": "656", "question": "how to properly clean your hair", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to properly clean your hair:\n\n1. Rinse your hair completely with water.\n2. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair.\n3. Apply a conditioner and allow it to remain on for a few minutes.\n4. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n5. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles.\n\nAdditionally, it is recommended to use a hair dryer to completely dry your hair after washing, and to be gentle when handling wet hair to prevent damage.", "pred": "To properly clean your hair, first select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type. Wet your hair with warm (not too hot) water in the shower, then apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo to your palm and work it through your hair, using your fingers to comb through longer hair and reduce tangles. Rinse the hair completely, and if it is longer, use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair. Apply conditioner in the same manner as shampoo, allow it to remain on for a few minutes, then rinse with cool water and comb through again. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing back and forth or in circles to prevent damage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: To properly clean your hair, first select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type. Wet your hair with warm (not too hot) water in the shower, then apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo to your palm and work it through your hair, using your fingers to comb through longer hair and reduce tangles. Rinse the hair completely, and if it is longer, use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair. Apply conditioner in the same manner as shampoo, allow it to remain on for a few minutes, then rinse with cool water and comb through again. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing back and forth or in circles to prevent damage.", "time_sec": 11.858, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 3870, 17103, 9375, 2143, 10188, 1044, 2158, 5762, 1278, 3875, 1627, 2372, 12078, 1321, 6570, 1258, 1394, 2143, 10188, 2658, 1046, 66195, 2143, 10188, 1454, 15701, 1319, 3715, 4382, 8480, 1041, 4180, 1294, 1278, 37809, 1044, 2430, 11145, 1261, 52718, 41720, 5647, 1307, 1627, 2372, 12078, 1317, 2143, 36631, 1321, 2196, 1494, 2645, 2143, 10188, 1044, 2505, 2143, 17296, 1317, 3830, 2645, 7934, 10188, 1321, 9980, 19953, 2013, 1046, 65117, 1415, 1278, 10188, 10185, 1044, 1321, 1693, 1494, 1395, 7934, 1044, 2210, 1261, 9924, 6793, 2279, 3830, 1317, 8559, 19953, 2013, 1321, 17208, 1278, 10188, 1046, 63882, 6570, 1258, 1294, 1278, 2879, 11665, 1435, 1627, 2372, 12078, 1044, 3894, 1494, 1317, 10399, 1408, 1394, 1261, 4517, 7334, 1044, 2430, 38124, 1415, 1454, 12921, 4180, 1321, 3830, 2645, 2790, 1046, 63322, 1278, 10188, 1454, 1261, 74537, 2505, 1261, 2350, 3333, 1505, 69956, 1302, 12968, 1044, 40052, 77487, 2595, 1321, 19888, 1505, 1294, 35438, 1317, 7495, 10605, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.0802, -0.0106, -0.3271, -0.007, -0.0, -0.0026, -0.0, -0.0304, -0.1952, -0.2655, -0.1215, -0.6737, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0215, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0043, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.6177, -0.6337, -0.0899, -0.0, -0.12, -0.0008, -0.2752, -0.0102, -0.1712, -0.0, -0.0008, -0.0004, -0.8235, -0.0009, -0.0, -0.6163, -0.2762, -0.0115, -0.0013, -0.0023, -0.2231, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.1362, -0.012, -0.0015, -0.1283, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0005, -0.115, -0.0, -0.0384, -0.636, -0.0424, -0.0, -0.005, -0.0009, -0.003, -0.0376, -0.0, -0.5862, -0.0076, 0.0