{"id": "657", "question": "how to properly clean your hair", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's a step-by-step guide on how to properly clean your hair:\n\n1. Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\n2. Wet your hair thoroughly.\n3. Apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo into the palm of your hand and work it through your hair, combing through it with your fingers to reduce tangles if your hair is longer.\n4. Rinse the hair completely and use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair.\n5. Apply conditioner in the same manner as the shampoo and allow it to remain on for a few minutes.\n6. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n7. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing it back and forth or in circles.\n8. Use a hair dryer to completely dry your hair.\n\nTherefore, the steps to properly clean your hair are:\n\n1. Choose the right products.\n2. Wet your hair.\n3. Shampoo your hair.\n4. Rinse and detangle.\n5. Condition your hair.\n6. Rinse and comb.\n7. Dry your hair with a towel.\n8. Use a hair dryer.", "pred": "To properly clean your hair, first select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type. Wet your hair with warm (not too hot) water in the shower, then apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo to your palm and work it through your hair, using your fingers to comb through longer hair and reduce tangles. Rinse the hair completely, and if it is longer, use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair. Apply conditioner in the same manner as shampoo, allow it to remain on for a few minutes, then rinse with cool water and comb through again. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing back and forth or in circles to prevent damage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: To properly clean your hair, first select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type. Wet your hair with warm (not too hot) water in the shower, then apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo to your palm and work it through your hair, using your fingers to comb through longer hair and reduce tangles. Rinse the hair completely, and if it is longer, use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair. Apply conditioner in the same manner as shampoo, allow it to remain on for a few minutes, then rinse with cool water and comb through again. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing back and forth or in circles to prevent damage.", "time_sec": 11.925, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 3870, 17103, 9375, 2143, 10188, 1044, 2158, 5762, 1278, 3875, 1627, 2372, 12078, 1321, 6570, 1258, 1394, 2143, 10188, 2658, 1046, 66195, 2143, 10188, 1454, 15701, 1319, 3715, 4382, 8480, 1041, 4180, 1294, 1278, 37809, 1044, 2430, 11145, 1261, 52718, 41720, 5647, 1307, 1627, 2372, 12078, 1317, 2143, 36631, 1321, 2196, 1494, 2645, 2143, 10188, 1044, 2505, 2143, 17296, 1317, 3830, 2645, 7934, 10188, 1321, 9980, 19953, 2013, 1046, 65117, 1415, 1278, 10188, 10185, 1044, 1321, 1693, 1494, 1395, 7934, 1044, 2210, 1261, 9924, 6793, 2279, 3830, 1317, 8559, 19953, 2013, 1321, 17208, 1278, 10188, 1046, 63882, 6570, 1258, 1294, 1278, 2879, 11665, 1435, 1627, 2372, 12078, 1044, 3894, 1494, 1317, 10399, 1408, 1394, 1261, 4517, 7334, 1044, 2430, 38124, 1415, 1454, 12921, 4180, 1321, 3830, 2645, 2790, 1046, 63322, 1278, 10188, 1454, 1261, 74537, 2505, 1261, 2350, 3333, 1505, 69956, 1302, 12968, 1044, 40052, 77487, 2595, 1321, 19888, 1505, 1294, 35438, 1317, 7495, 10605, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.0802, -0.0106, -0.3271, -0.007, -0.0, -0.0026, -0.0, -0.0304, -0.1952, -0.2655, -0.1215, -0.67