{"id": "659", "question": "vinegar uses for dogs", "gt": "Vinegar can be used to improve a dog's skin and coat, clean out their ears, repel fleas, and soothe itchy ears.", "pred": "Vinegar can be used for dogs in several ways:", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Vinegar can be used for dogs in several ways:  \n- Mix 1 cup of vinegar with 2-4 cups of water for a final rinse to rejuvenate the coat and balance skin pH levels.  \n- Spray vinegar full-strength on the dog’s coat to normalize skin pH balance.  \n- Dilute apple cider vinegar with 50% water to soothe itchy ears using a cotton swab or gauze pad.  \n- Use vinegar in ear cleaning, flea repellent sprays, and flea baths (mixed with soap) to fight fleas.  \n- Rinse the dog after flea treatments.", "time_sec": 11.236, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 110382, 8374, 1710, 1402, 2434, 1394, 25007, 1294, 4631, 9384, 1058, 1256, 1010, 1045, 28978, 1032, 1049, 19339, 1307, 61359, 8374, 1454, 1032, 1050, 1045, 1052, 60180, 1307, 4180, 1394, 1261, 2778, 38124, 1415, 1317, 1344, 5517, 2154, 1419, 1278, 26100, 1321, 13864, 9877, 1274, 1072, 5283, 1046, 1256, 1010, 1045, 3434, 2291, 61359, 8374, 5275, 37086, 2750, 1408, 1278, 10575, 2190, 26100, 1317, 60465, 9877, 1274, 1072, 13864, 1046, 1256, 1010, 1045, 74207, 2654, 46227, 1272, 2506, 61359, 8374, 1454, 1032, 1053, 1048, 1037, 4180, 1317, 1878, 56211, 1494, 55906, 32961, 2505, 1261, 39694, 4250, 1401, 1505, 17089, 2343, 16441, 1046, 1256, 1010, 1045, 13516, 61359, 8374, 1294, 16962, 28685, 1044, 11565, 1097, 5634, 15165, 1942, 13210, 1044, 1321, 11565, 1097, 19436, 1115, 1319, 1109, 5422, 1454, 50584, 1041, 1317, 9817, 11565, 1288, 1046, 1256, 1010, 1045, 65117, 1415, 12