{"id": "681", "question": "how to get free voip service and phone number", "gt": "To get a free VoIP service and phone number, you can visit YouTube channels which provide tutorials on how to access these services, such as the video available at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037. You could also use cloud VoIP services that require no equipment on your end. These services offer toll-free and US local numbers that can be forwarded to any US number or used with SIP devices for outgoing calls. Additionally, companies offer DID or incoming numbers from around the world either for a flat yearly rate or a monthly fee.", "pred": "To get free VoIP service and a phone number, you can visit the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037, where a video demonstrates how to obtain a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP) from Google, a respected company.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: To get free VoIP service and a phone number, you can visit the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037, where a video demonstrates how to obtain a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP) from Google, a respected company.", "time_sec": 4.956, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 3870, 2012, 5370, 11962, 9918, 4810, 1321, 1261, 9916, 2782, 1044, 1636, 1710, 9206, 1278, 3213, 21670, 9129, 1513, 6924, 2345, 6132, 63544, 2354, 24390, 1047, 12371, 1318, 1050, 1048, 1051, 1055, 1044, 2478, 1261, 7476, 33097, 2606, 1317, 4800, 1261, 5370, 43488, 42743, 13920, 1319, 25313, 9918, 1041, 1562, 13346, 1044, 1261, 60935, 6580, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.0983, -0.0098, -0.7256, -0.0129, -0.3227, -0.022, -0.0, -0.0054, -0.0004, -0.049, -0.0029, -0.0, -0.0017, -0.2923, -0.0018, -0.2