{"id": "699", "question": "How do you make ice cream", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here is how you can make ice cream:\n\n1. Pour cold ice cream mix into an ice cream maker and turn on the machine, following the manufacturer's instructions (passage 1).\n2. Stir sugar, cream, and milk into a saucepan over low heat until sugar has dissolved, then heat just until a small ring of foam appears around the edge (passage 2).\n3. Transfer the cream mixture to a pourable container and stir in vanilla extract before chilling the mix thoroughly for at least 2 hours (passage 2).\n4. Once the ice cream base is ready, pour it into the ice cream maker and churn according to the manufacturer's instructions (passage 1).\n5. When the ice cream is softly frozen, serve immediately or place a piece of plastic wrap directly on the ice cream and place it in the freezer to ripen for 2 to 3 hours (passage 1).\n\nNote that the passages do not provide a specific recipe for making ice cream, but rather provide general steps and tips for making ice cream using an ice cream maker.", "pred": "To make ice cream, first stir sugar, cream, and milk into a saucepan over low heat until the sugar has dissolved, then heat the mixture just until it is hot and a small ring of foam appears around the edge. Transfer the cream mixture to a pourable container and stir in vanilla extract, chilling the mix thoroughly for at least 2 hours. Pour the cold mix into an ice cream maker, turn on the machine, and churn for 20 to 25 minutes. When the ice cream is softly frozen, serve it immediately or place a piece of plastic wrap directly on the ice cream and freeze to ripen for 2 to 3 hours.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: To make ice cream, first stir sugar, cream, and milk into a saucepan over low heat until the sugar has dissolved, then heat the mixture just until it is hot and a small ring of foam appears around the edge. Transfer the cream mixture to a pourable container and stir in vanilla extract, chilling the mix thoroughly for at least 2 hours. Pour the cold mix into an ice cream maker, turn on the machine, and churn for 20 to 25 minutes. When the ice cream is softly frozen, serve it immediately or place a piece of plastic wrap directly on the ice cream and freeze to ripen for 2 to 3 hours.", "time_sec": 10.354, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 3870, 3180, 16254, 38423, 1044, 2158, 22903, 24224, 1044, 38423, 1044, 1321, 21842, 2203, 1261, 52812, 6318, 2136, 4253, 9374, 4570, 1278, 24224, 1934, 28862, 1044, 2430, 9374, 1278, 13810, 2586, 4570, 1494, 1395, 8480, 1321, 1261, 3709, 10749, 1307, 50842, 10249, 3879, 1278, 10314, 1046, 44250, 1278, 38423, 13810, 1317, 1261, 6212, 30831, 11024, 1321, 22903, 1294, 99927, 9041, 1044, 1528, 9184, 1278, 11986, 43850, 1394, 1513, 4403, 1032, 1050, 7700, 1046, 10108, 1278, 13074, 11986, 2203, 1420, 16254, 38423, 69947, 1044, 3884, 1408, 1278, 8832, 1044, 1321, 121978, 1394, 1032, 1050, 1048, 1317, 1032, 1050, 1053, 7334, 1046, 4925, 1278, 16254, 38423, 1395, 45118, 32362, 1044, 11584, 1494, 10912, 1505, 3535, 1261, 13079, 1307, 17985, 30711, 7655, 1408, 1278, 16254, 38423, 1321, 52659, 1317, 21033, 1262, 1394, 1032, 1050, 1317, 1032, 1051, 7700, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.1198, -0.0281, -0.514, -0.0001, -0.0009, -0.0006, -0.0113, -0.966, -0.8524, -0.0099, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0029, -0.0, -0.0601, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0036, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0947, -0.132, -0.0, -0.6579, -0.0004, -0.6582, -0.6494, -0.0001, -0.4047, -0.2299, -0.2243, -0.0002, -0.2303, -0.1417, -0.0, -0.0558, -0.0009, -0.0001, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0235, -0.0004, -0.0, -0.0, -0.5533, -0.1543, -0.0086, -0.0557, -0.0005, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.2155,