{"id": "702", "question": "what do children learn with water play", "gt": "Children learn various skills and concepts through water play. They develop gross motor skills by running through sprinklers and pouring water. Water play also provides opportunities for academic learning, such as understanding concepts like floating and sinking, measuring water, and comparing quantities. Additionally, water play encourages creativity and imagination as children pretend and engage in imaginative play with water.", "pred": "Children learn about gross motor skills, science concepts like floating and sinking, math concepts like measuring, and creativity through water play.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Children learn about gross motor skills, science concepts like floating and sinking, math concepts like measuring, and creativity through water play.", "time_sec": 2.773, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 23380, 8178, 2314, 23795, 9085, 14627, 1044, 12470, 20975, 2479, 32449, 1321, 80483, 1044, 20267, 20975, 2479, 21747, 1044, 1321, 57432, 2645, 4180, 3354, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.108, -0.0435, -0.0447, -0.0002, -0.2793, -0.0708, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.066, -0.4434, -0.2445, -0.3702, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0019, -0.0275, -0.018, -0.6597, -0.0002, -0.8953, -0.0036, -0.0022, -0.0263, -0.2372, -0.0, -0.0814, -0.0825], "cumulative_logprob": -3.7069, "norm_logp": -0.1278, "input_len": 438, "output_tokens": 29, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 45.9, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "705", "question": "what do children learn with water play", "gt": "Based on the given passages, children learn the following through water play:\n\n1. Gross motor skills: Running, pouring, and manipulating water helps develop fine and gross motor skills. (Passage 1)\n2. Science concepts: Floating and sinking, measurement, and experimentation with different objects in water. (Passage 1)\n3. Creativity and imagination: Water play encourages children to use their imagination and engage in pretend play. (Passage 1)\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages. The passages do not mention any other specific academic learning outcomes beyond gross motor skills, science concepts, and creativity.", "pred": "Children learn about gross motor skills, science concepts like floating and sinking, math concepts like measuring, and creativity through water play.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: Children learn about gross motor skills, science concepts like floating and sinking, math concepts like measuring, and creativity through water play.", "time_sec": 2.882, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 23380, 8178, 2314, 23795, 9085, 14627, 1044, 12470, 20975, 2479, 32449, 1321, 80483, 1044, 20267, 20975, 2479, 21747, 1044, 1321, 57432, 2645, 4180, 3354, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.108, -0.0435, -0.0447, -0.0002, -0.2793, -0.0708, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.066, -0.4434, -0.2445, -0.3702, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0019, -0.0275, -0.018, -0.6597, -0.0002, -0.8953, -0.0036, -0.0022, -0.0263, -0.2372, -0.0, -0.0814, -0.0825], "cumulative_logprob": -3.7069, "norm_logp": -0.1278, "input_len": 438, "output_tokens": 29, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.89, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.