{"id": "715", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest are:\n\n1. Modified tri-set for the chest (mentioned in passage 2)\n2. Pushups with heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses (mentioned in passage 2)\n\nThese exercises are designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue surrounding them, allowing for more muscle growth.", "pred": "The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passages, are a modified tri-set for the chest and a combination of pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. The modified tri-set is designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue around them, while the second chest blast pairs pushups with heavy dumbbell bench presses to further develop the chest muscles.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: The exercises that tone the chest, as described in the passages, are a modified tri-set for the chest and a combination of pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. The modified tri-set is designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue around them, while the second chest blast pairs pushups with heavy dumbbell bench presses to further develop the chest muscles.", "time_sec": 6.591, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 1531, 39693, 1455, 20294, 1278, 15448, 1044, 1435, 5055, 1294, 1278, 42679, 1044, 1584, 1261, 13330, 3104, 48511, 1394, 1278, 15448, 1321, 1261, 9943, 1307, 11354, 27988, 1454, 3435, 12203, 10651, 1307, 48313, 4600, 1522, 26808, 81245, 1046, 1531, 13330, 3104, 48511, 1395, 9543, 1317, 18064, 1278, 25108, 1115, 1321, 34623, 1278, 94538, 9392, 3879, 2424, 1044, 3016, 1278, 2667, 15448, 38894, 17684,