{"id": "736", "question": "what is the difference between sms and mms", "gt": "The difference between SMS and MMS is that SMS allows you to send text-only messages of up to 160 characters, while MMS allows you to send messages with pictures, sounds, videos, and text, with a larger content size of up to 300KB.", "pred": "SMS (Short Message Service) is restricted to sending text-only messages, while MMS (Multimedia Messaging Service) allows sending pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of these. SMS messages are limited to 160 characters and are split into multiple parts if longer, whereas MMS messages can carry up to 300KB of content in formats like WAV, JPEG, and GIF.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_dola_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: SMS (Short Message Service) is restricted to sending text-only messages, while MMS (Multimedia Messaging Service) allows sending pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of these. SMS messages are limited to 160 characters and are split into multiple parts if longer, whereas MMS messages can carry up to 300KB of content in formats like WAV, JPEG, and GIF.", "time_sec": 7.028, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}, "premature_layer": 28, "alpha": 0.1}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 31106, 1058, 54030, 1319, 28897, 16460, 10788, 1041, 1395, 23672, 1317, 20234, 3403, 31463, 14193, 1044, 3016, 1373, 7985, 1319, 20934, 23953, 19497, 8234, 10788, 1041, 9985, 20234, 23874, 1044, 18267, 1044, 26612, 1044, 3403, 1044, 1505, 2258, 9943, 1307, 2576, 1046, 54030, 14193, 1584, 8031, 1317, 1032, 1049, 1054, 1048, 11084, 1321, 1584, 13156, 2203, 6245, 8262, 1693, 7934, 1044, 11275, 1373, 7985, 14193, 1710, 10739, 2015, 1317, 1032, 1051, 1048, 1048, 60305, 1307, 4701, 1294, 40397, 2479, 1488, 29970, 1044, 124060, 1044, 1321, 1461, 11098, 1046,